rm: translateY(-4px)}\n.card-num {display: inline-block;font-size: 13px;color: #2dd4bf;font-weight: 700;margin-bottom: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px}\n.card h3 {font-size: 19px;margin-bottom: 10px;color: #2b343d}\n.card p {font-size: 14px;color: #6b7280}\n\n/* Plans */\n.plans-section {background: #e9edf0}\n.plans-list {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 16px}\n.plan-row {background: #fff;border-radius: 16px;padding: 28px 32px;display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 2fr;gap: 24px;align-items: center;box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(43, 52, 61, 0.06)}\n.plan-row.featured {border: 2px solid #2dd4bf;background: #f0fdfa}\n.plan-name {font-size: 20px;font-weight: 700}\n.plan-tag {display: inline-block;background: #2dd4bf;color: #fff;font-size: 11px;padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;margin-left: 8px;vertical-align: middle}\n.plan-price .price {font-size: 24px;font-weight: 700;color: #2b343d}\n.plan-price .annual {display: block;font-size: 13px;color: #6b7280;margin-top: 4px}\n.plan-features {list-style: none;font-size: 14px;color: #4b5563}\n.plan-features li {padding: 3px 0}\n.plan-features li::before {content: \"—\";color: #2dd4bf;margin-right: 8px}\n\n/* FAQ */\n.faq-list {list-style: none;counter-reset: faq}\n.faq-item {counter-increment: faq;padding: 24px 0;border-bottom: 1px solid #d1d5db}\n.faq-item:last-child {border-bottom: none}\n.faq-item h3::before {content: counter(faq, decimal-leading-zero);color: #2dd4bf;font-weight: 700;margin-right: 12px}\n.faq-item h3 {font-size: 17px;font-weight: 600;color: #2b343d;margin-bottom: 8px}\n.faq-item p {font-size: 15px;color: #6b7280;padding-left: 38px}\n\n/* Footer */\nfooter {background: #2b343d;color: #9ca3af;padding: 48px 0;text-align: center;font-size: 14px}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .hero-grid {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 24px}\n  .hero-main h1 {font-size: 48px}\n  .features-grid {grid-template-columns: 1fr}\n  .plan-row {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 16px}\n  .nav-inner {gap: 16px;font-size: 12px}\n  .section-title {font-size: 26px}\n}\n</style><header class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n      <div class=\"hero-main\">\n        <h1>简单云(simpleyun) · 简单云<br><span>simpleyun</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"hero-tagline\">不堆砌概念。只做一件事：把网络连接变简单。</p>\n        <p class=\"hero-quote\">\"连接不应是技术门槛，而是默认状态。我们去掉冗余选项，留下真正有用的部分。\"</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-col\">\n        <h3>本期内容</h3>\n        <p>核心特性总览</p>\n        <p>三档套餐明细</p>\n        <p>客户端使用指南</p>\n        <p>常见问题清单</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-col\">\n        <h3>适合谁</h3>\n        <p>需要稳定跨境访问的个人</p>\n        <p>远程办公的小型团队</p>\n        <p>对流量有明确预算的用户</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<nav class=\"nav-bar\">\n  <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n    <a href=\"#features\">特性</a>\n    <a href=\"#plans\">套餐</a>\n    <a href=\"#usage\">使用</a>\n    <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n  <section id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">我们做了什么</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">四个方向，覆盖从接入到日常使用的完整链路。</p>\n      <div class=\"features-grid\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"card-num\">01</span>\n          <h3>流量清晰可见</h3>\n          <p>每份套餐标注明确流量额度。用完即止，不偷跑、不虚标。后台随时查看剩余。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"card-num\">02</span>\n          <h3>多端同时在线</h3>\n          <p>一个账号支持多设备并行。手机、平板、电脑同时连接，互不挤占通道。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"card-num\">03</span>\n          <h3>节点分层可选</h3>\n          <p>基础节点池满足日常浏览。旗舰及以上提供专线优化，应对高带宽与低延迟场景。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"card-num\">04</span>\n          <h3>无暗藏条款</h3>\n          <p>价格即最终价格。无激活费、无提速包、无节点分区加价。所见即所得。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"plans\" class=\"plans-section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">三档套餐</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">按流量与设备需求选择。年付有折扣，无自动续费陷阱。</p>\n      <div class=\"plans-list\">\n        <div class=\"plan-row\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"plan-name\">基础版</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">\n            <span class=\"price\">¥15/月</span>\n            <span class=\"annual\">年付 ¥150/年</span>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 100GB 流量</li>\n            <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-row featured\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版<span class=\"plan-tag\">推荐</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">\n            <span class=\"price\">¥35/月</span>\n            <span class=\"annual\">年付 ¥350/年</span>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 300GB 流量</li>\n            <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n            <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n            <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-row\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"plan-name\">团队版</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">\n            <span class=\"price\">¥85/月</span>\n            <span class=\"annual\">年付 ¥850/年</span>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 1000GB 流量</li>\n            <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n            <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n            <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"usage\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">如何使用</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">三步完成。不需要阅读说明书。</p>\n      <div class=\"features-grid\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"card-num\">步骤一</span>\n          <h3>选择套餐并订阅</h3>\n          <p>根据常用设备和流量消耗选择对应档位。订阅后账号即时开通，无需等待审核。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"card-num\">步骤二</span>\n          <h3>获取客户端配置</h3>\n          <p>登录后台获取订阅链接。将链接导入常用客户端，节点列表自动同步更新。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <span class=\"card-num\">步骤三</span>\n          <h3>连接并使用</h3>\n          <p>选择目标节点，点击连接。系统会自动适配最优协议。日常使用无需手动干预。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见问题</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">关于流量、设备和售后最常被问到的几件事。</p>\n      <ol class=\"faq-list\">\n        <li class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3>流量用完后会怎样？</h3>\n          <p>流量用尽后连接会自动暂停，不会产生额外扣费。可等待下月周期重置，或手动升级套餐补足流量。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3>不同设备同时在线会互相影响吗？</h3>\n          <p>不会。每台设备独立建立通道，带宽按需分配。只要设备总数不超过套餐上限，各自速度不受限。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3>年付和月付的权益有区别吗？</h3>\n          <p>没有。年付仅是价格上的优惠，套餐内流量、设备数、节点权限完全一致。不会因年付而增加或减少功能。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3>可以在路由器上使用吗？</h3>\n          <p>支持兼容主流客户端协议的路由器固件。但全局路由会消耗较多流量，建议仅在团队版的大流量场景下使用。</p>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p>简单云 (simpleyun) · 让连接回到简单本身</p>\n  </div>\n</footer>",
